From: X-WRT <dev@x-wrt.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 16:30:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: keep AN7563 LAN QDMA profile

The unified initialization applies a block of EN7523 QDMA register values
to both AN7563 instances.  The original AN7563 datapath leaves QDMA0 on
the generic LAN profile and applies its special settings only to QDMA1.

Keep the EN7523 values on AN7563 QDMA1 for the working WAN path, but do
not overwrite the QDMA0 LAN configuration with them.

Signed-off-by: X-WRT <dev@x-wrt.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c
@@ -3358,6 +3358,7 @@ static int airoha_qdma_modern_hw_init
 				       TX_COHERENT_HIGH_INT_MASK);
 
-	if (airoha_is(qdma->eth, airoha_en7523, airoha_an7563)) {
+	if (airoha_is(qdma->eth, airoha_en7523) ||
+	    airoha_is_an7563_qdma_wan(qdma)) {
 		airoha_qdma_wr(qdma, 0x30, 0x7C000000);
 		airoha_qdma_wr(qdma, 0x34, 0x7C007C00);
 		airoha_qdma_wr(qdma, 0x38, 0x00200000);
-- 
2.51.0
